          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Our store, formerly known as \"Worn Relics Appraisal and Recycling,\" specializes in various ancient relic appraisal, repair, and recycling"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The store is small, but it has been with Rivet Town through its ups and downs"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It has also become a reputable store in Rivet Town"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Now it is time to give back to the enthusiastic and supportive community"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "From today, our shop will be renamed"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "With added services on top the store's original specialties:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And many more new services!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-100e2ac8a1441301"
          },
